{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3186f1565950d9fbfd533be0208813da.avif?t=1755223230\" width=616 height=160 /></span><strong>&quot;Loafing Town&quot;</strong> is a <strong>desktop idle game</strong> designed for PC\u2014your ultimate workday distraction!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=688 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Step into the role of a god-like overseer and build a thriving hero village. Starting with just a lone hero and a simple thatched hut, you'll gradually attract more heroes and transform your humble village into a bustling town.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/f7cfa607b3978577ba8304f40ae747cb.avif?t=1755223230\" width=616 height=160 /></span>The gameplay is simple yet engaging: <strong>summon monsters</strong> to train heroes, <strong>earn gold</strong> to develop the village, <strong>upgrade houses and facilities</strong>, <strong>cast magic</strong> to assist heroes in battle, and even <strong>sacrifice heroes</strong> for unexpected rewards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=698 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>god-view grabbing system</strong> and a <strong>physics-based interaction</strong>, the game delivers a delightful sandbox experience, perfect for idle play during work or study breaks. Watch your village grow and enjoy the laid-back charm of progression.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=698 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/2cd7d079722dbc3f51d599e14ec59e8e.avif?t=1755223230\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to slack off not only in the game but also in the community, come join us and chat together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please follow me on X! @Tenffy_Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like <i>Loafing Town</i>, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866820?t=1755223230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866820?t=1755223230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/3ac7df76af4d83ed1ccb6d5bcc594ca65d5b0d77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755223230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/3ac7df76af4d83ed1ccb6d5bcc594ca65d5b0d77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755223230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3186f1565950d9fbfd533be0208813da.avif?t=1755223230\" width=616 height=160 /></span><strong>&quot;Loafing Town&quot;</strong> is a <strong>desktop idle game</strong> designed for PC\u2014your ultimate workday distraction!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=688 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/