/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>god-view grabbing system</strong> and a <strong>physics-based interaction</strong>, the game delivers a delightful sandbox experience, perfect for idle play during work or study breaks. Watch your village grow and enjoy the laid-back charm of progression.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.poster.avif?t=1755223230\" width=698 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.webm?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.mp4?t=1755223230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/extras/2cd7d079722dbc3f51d599e14ec59e8e.avif?t=1755223230\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to slack off not only in the game but also in the community, come join us and chat together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please follow me on X! @Tenffy_Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like <i>Loafing Town</i>, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["GoblinZz"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3625210","name":"Loafing Town"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866820/f58463cb5e882ed61193c04362ceee49fc962bb8/header.jpg